# Shape only. Copy to `.env`, which is gitignored.
#
# `PUBLIC_` is Astro's prefix for a variable allowed into the browser bundle. Everything
# here is public by definition — a marketing site that needed a secret would be doing
# something wrong.

# The trading app. A separate deploy at its own origin, so every "Launch app" link is
# absolute and this is the only place that origin is written down.
PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.example.com
